{"id":744,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"This Pokémon intimidates opponents by striking the ground with the rocks on its neck. The moment an opponent flinches, Rockruff attacks."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"This Pokémon can bond very strongly with its Trainer, but it also has a habit of biting. Raising a Rockruff for a long time can be challenging."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"When it rubs the rocks on its neck against you, that’s proof of its love for you. However, the rocks are sharp, so the gesture is quite painful!"},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"As they develop, their disposition grows more violent and aggressive. Many Trainers find them too much to handle and abandon them."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"This Pokémon has lived with people since times long ago. It can sense when its Trainer is in the dumps and will stick close by its Trainer’s side."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It’s considered to be a good Pokémon for beginners because of its friendliness, but its disposition grows rougher as it grows up."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Keen Eye","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's keen eyes prevent its accuracy from being lowered."},{"name":"Vital Spirit","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is full of vitality, and that prevents it from falling asleep."},{"name":"Steadfast","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's determination boosts its Speed stat every time it flinches."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Brown","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":744,"name":"Rockruff","condition":null,"children":[{"id":745,"name":"Lycanroc","condition":"Lv. 25 (Day) or Lv. 25 (Night) or Lv. 25 (Dusk)","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,43],[4,28],[8,104],[12,88],[16,336],[20,44],[24,317],[28,46],[32,157],[36,242],[40,184],[44,446],[48,444]],"machine":[34,523,204,242,91,38,414,283,203,263,424,270,304,334,442,189,583,182,706,156,46,157,